  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">DECE-LE Admission Result / Rank Card 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T15:37:25+05:30\">June 4, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">3:37 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</a>, </strong>has released the <strong>Result / Rank Card</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"335\">Diploma Entrance Competitive Examination–Lateral Entry (DECE-LE) 2026</strong>. The exam was conducted on&nbsp;<strong>24 May 2026,</strong>&nbsp;and the last date to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">23 April 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Result / Rank Card</strong>&nbsp;using&nbsp;their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The&nbsp;<strong>direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">DECE-LE Result / Rank Card 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">DECE-LE Admission 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/dece-le-admission-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <b>20 March 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date :<b> 23 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <b>24 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>25-26 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong>&nbsp; 24 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <b>15 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 04 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>All Category Male &amp; Female Candidates</strong>&nbsp;: <b><strong>₹&nbsp;</strong>2200/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>&nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">DECE-LE Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On BCECEB Rules.</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age<strong> : N/A</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>N/A</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check More Details For<strong> DECE LE 2026 </strong>Visit<strong> Official Website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">20310 Seats</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">DECE-LE Online Form 2026 : Admission Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5529%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Entrance Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 76.4471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.5529%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Diploma Entrance Competitive Examination (Lateral Entry) DECE-LE 2026</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 76.4471%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"184\">passed Intermediate (12th) in Science with Physics and Chemistry as compulsory subjects along with either Mathematics or Biology</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"222\">12th Science with Mathematics</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"279\">12th Science with a vocational/technical subject</strong>. Alternatively, candidates with <strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"360\">10th pass along with ITI in a relevant trade</strong> are also eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-bpsc-33rd-judicial-services-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bihar BPSC 33rd Judicial Services Recruitment 2026</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download DECE-LE Result / Rank Card 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Visit the official<strong> BCECEB website.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;On the homepage, click on the <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"171\">“DECE (LE) Result / Rank Card 2026”</strong>&nbsp;link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Enter your <strong data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"208\">Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"230\">Date of Birth</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"265\">Submit/Login</strong>&nbsp;button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Your <strong>DECE-LE 2026 Rank Card</strong> will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Check your <strong>score, rank, and other details</strong> carefully.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Download the <strong>Rank Card PDF</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Take a printout of the <strong>Rank Card for the counselling</strong> and admission process.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\